<back><div type="verses">
<lg label="2."><l>Lord, I give myself to You again today</l><l>Your mercy reached me though I was so far away</l><l>You gave Yourself for me</l><l>From whose earthly dreams You freed</l><l>Lord, I am Yours alone.</l></lg>
<lg label="3."><l>Lord, I give myself to You again today</l><l>I open to You so that You may have a way</l><l>To work in me that I</l><l>Might serve You my whole life</l><l>Lord, I love You alone.</l></lg>
</div>
</back>
</music></mei>
